    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d42">

                <pb facs="0108" n="58" xml:id="pg58"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Senhor Mendonça to Mr. Gresham.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States of Brazil</hi>,<lb/><hi
                                rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1894-04-19"><hi rendition="#italic">April 19,
                                1894</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to communicate to your
                    excellency the following cablegram just received from my Government: <quote
                        rend="blockquote">
                        <p><hi rendition="#italic">Aquidaban</hi> was sunk in the port of Santa
                            Catharina by torpedo boat of the fleet of the Brazilian Government.
                            Mello went to Buenos Ayres with the cruiser <hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Republica</hi> and four other vessels; asked for and obtained
                            asylum, declaring to abandon the contention, for lack of resources.
                            Delivered vessels to Argentine Government. Rebellion ended.</p>
                    </quote></p>
                <p>Accept, etc.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Salvador de
                    Mendonca.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
